  "style_version": "1.1",
  "name": "Copycat Opus: the yard of the trailer",
  "summary": "Stylised, soft and warm: simple readable shapes with gently chamfered edges, painted-looking surfaces with real grain under the paint, a pastel hazy light with a lavender sky; nothing glossy that is not really glossy, nothing plastic-looking.",
  "stylisation": {
    "anchor": "the trailer's yard: a cosy, stylised garden game, simple painted forms under a soft pastel light",
    "tie_breaker": "readability from the game camera beats realism; the source frames beat taste",
    "modelled_vs_painted": "a feature smaller than the detail floor of its class is painted into the texture or left out",
